---
import ArrowIcon from '../components/ArrowIcon.astro';
import SupportShell from '../components/SupportShell.astro';
import ActionIcon from '../components/ActionIcon.astro';
---
<SupportShell title="Contact JotColoring" description="A question, a page that needs a closer look, or a creative project you want to discuss? Here is the right place to start." kind="help" eyebrow="HELLO, CREATIVE PERSON."><div slot="hero" class="support-hero-meta"><span>jotcoloring@gmail.com</span></div><div class="support-card-grid"><section class="support-card"><ActionIcon name="heart"/><h2>Questions & feedback</h2><p>Tell us which page you are using and what you would like to do. Include the URL and the message you saw if something went wrong.</p><a href="mailto:jotcoloring@gmail.com?subject=JotColoring%20question">Write an email<ArrowIcon kind="right" size={18}/></a></section><section class="support-card"><ActionIcon name="pdf"/><h2>A project with our artwork?</h2><p>Send the page links and the scope of your project. Commercial use needs written permission before publishing or selling.</p><a href="/licensing/">Prepare a license request<ArrowIcon kind="right" size={18}/></a></section><section class="support-card"><ActionIcon name="brush"/><h2>A more accessible experience</h2><p>Describe the barrier, your browser and the adjustment that would help. Share assistive-technology details only if you are comfortable doing so.</p><a href="/accessibility/">Accessibility information<ArrowIcon kind="right" size={18}/></a></section></div><div class="support-note"><strong>Share only what is needed.</strong><p>Email links open your email app; they do not send automatically. Please do not include passwords, payment details or sensitive photos. A privacy request can be sent to the same address with “Privacy request” in the subject.</p></div><div class="support-section-heading"><h2>Looking for a quick answer?</h2><p>Printing, local saves, AI availability and common licensing questions are covered in our help center.</p><div class="support-actions"><a href="/help/" class="support-button">Visit the Help center<ArrowIcon kind="right" size={18}/></a><a href="/faq/" class="support-button secondary">Browse all questions<ArrowIcon kind="right" size={18}/></a></div></div></SupportShell>
